@startuml
title UML - frozen outgoing payment reconciliation and ownership recovery
actor "Current Finance maker" as maker
participant "Workforce BFF / Finance API" as api
participant "Immutable parent report" as report
participant "Independent clearing provider" as file
participant "Core read-only accounting port" as core
participant "Payments read-only lineage port" as payments
database "Finance observations" as store
participant "Bounded recovery worker" as worker
participant "Controls cases" as cases
maker -> api : capture(reportId, fileId, actor/client/key)
api -> api : authenticate + current Finance role/queue
api -> store : exact accepted request replay lookup
alt existing accepted key
 store --> api : original artifact, never refresh evidence
else new request
 api -> report : verify original report / GL archive membership
 report --> api : frozen journal + GL proof, original as-of / digest
 api -> file : fresh signed kind / file ID / nonce inquiry
 file --> api : signed exact request + immutable independent file
 api -> api : verify scope, signature and bounded raw row claims
 api -> core : bounded repeatable-read accounting facts
 core --> api : native receipt / finality / journal links + source clock
 api -> payments : bounded repeatable-read original quote / transport / receipts
 payments --> api : source lineage + separate source clock
 api -> core : confirm native receipts after Payments capture
 core --> api : committed facts including explicit file / workflow identities
 api -> api : union original identities; exact principal / bank fee / provider fee
 api -> api : currency partitions / accounts / dates / duplicates / timing / GL
 api -> store : lock actor/client/key; recheck current authority
 api -> store : commit immutable summary / sources / rows / issues + audit
end
api --> maker : saved run ID / digest / explicit completeness
worker -> store : next 50 unassigned issues, wrapping cursor
loop each issue; advance past scope/dependency failure
 worker -> cases : ensure Finance case with stable issue origin
 cases --> worker : original case ID, including after lost ACK
 worker -> store : link case ID once
end
maker -> api : reopen original run / stable ordinal pages
api -> api : verify hashes + archived file integrity
api --> maker : retained observations / safe lineage / current ownership wrapper
note over api,core
No financial command, hold release, new rail submission or GL replay.
A later file or new financial fact requires a new report/run.
end note
@enduml
